[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0564","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0733","title":"SGI IRIX TelnetD 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统的 TelnetD 服务存在格式字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标发送特制的 IAC-SB-TELOPT_ENVIRON 请求，在 RLD 环境变量中注入格式字符串符号，导致服务器解析时执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 IRIX 5.2 至 6.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Telnet 服务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0733"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.137","remediation":"建议升级 IRIX 至 6.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 telnetd 格式字符串漏洞；如无法升级，可通过 chkconfig telnet off 禁用 telnet 服务，或使用防火墙限制 telnet 访问来源（仅允许可信 IP），并尽早迁移至 SSH。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1572","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20149","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0733.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0733","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0733.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0733.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-79jr-hhg4-h2jm/GHSA-79jr-hhg4-h2jm.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/7db1c0aca641164bcc9422b571eb34ddf2f0494c/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/Vulnetix/cli/blob/4f24bba0119f28848f58e0b4cad65337f6bcfe11/website/content/docs/sast-rules/vnx-c-002.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e4b2d707-3783-44f3-98d7-ea201106269b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0562","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0721","title":"Multisoft FlagShip 4.4 安装权限漏洞","description":"Multisoft FlagShip 4.4 中的 FSserial、FlagShip_c 和 FlagShip_p 程序安装时被设置为全局可写权限，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞将正常程序替换为特洛伊木马程序，从而在目标系统上以其他用户（包括管理员）权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。建议用户手动修复文件权限以防止被利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0721"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20.517","remediation":"建议立即移除 FSserial、FlagShip_c、FlagShip_p 三文件的全局写入权限（chmod o-w /path/to/FSserial /path/to/FlagShip_c /path/to/FlagShip_p），或升级 Multisoft 官方补丁版本重新安装；若文件以 setuid root 运行，应移除 setuid 位（chmod u-s）作为加深防御。定期检查关键系统文件权限以防篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1586","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0721","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0721.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5j27-r362-gvrr/GHSA-5j27-r362-gvrr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1586/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e211cf84-71fc-40a4-8663-8c844821e4ae.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0561","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0720","title":"GWScripts News Publisher 1.0 认证绕过漏洞","description":"GWScripts News Publisher 1.0 的 news.cgi 脚本在处理作者添加请求时存在认证缺失漏洞，远程攻击者无需任何身份验证即可通过向 new.cgi 程序直接发送 HTTP POST 请求，携带 addAuthor 参数并将 Referer 头伪造为 news.cgi，从而向作者列表中添加新的作者账号。该漏洞允许攻击者获得后台管理访问权限，进而可能导致后续的内容篡改或恶意发布。可利用性较高，影响 GWScripts News Publisher 1.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0720"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20.387","remediation":"立即升级到 GWScripts News Publisher 的最新版本（如已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的新闻发布系统）。在无法升级的情况下，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面对 /new.cgi 路径添加 IP 白名单或 HTTP 基本认证限制，仅允许管理员 IP 访问；同时在 news.cgi 中增加服务端 session 认证机制，禁止仅凭 Referer 头进行身份校验。删除 author.file 中未授权的异常条目并定期审计文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1621","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=003301c0123b%2418f8c1a0%24953b29d4%40e8s9s4","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5169","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0720","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0720.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vr7c-vmw2-482c/GHSA-vr7c-vmw2-482c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--514951a9-bdb0-4662-aa7d-4fd71eae6c90.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--514951a9-bdb0-4662-aa7d-4fd71eae6c90.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0561.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0561.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0559","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0711","title":"Netscape Communicator 恶意 Applet 服务器套接字漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 未能正确限制不可信 Java applet 创建 ServerSocket 对象，导致远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发恶意 applet，在受害者系统上创建任意监听端口，从而建立后门实现远程控制。该漏洞影响 Sun JDK/JRE 1.1.x 及 Netscape Communicator 浏览器，典型利用方式为 Brown Orifice 攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0711"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19.250","remediation":"升级至 JDK 1.2 或更高版本，该版本引入标准安全管理器 SecurityManager，默认禁止不可信 applet 创建 ServerSocket。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Java applet 支持，或通过防火墙限制出站异常连接。使用 Netscape Communicator 的用户建议升级至 4.74 以上版本或切换至其他浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-15.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1545","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000805020429.11774.qmail%40securityfocus.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=3999922128E.EE84TAKAGI%40java-house.etl.go.jp","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20139","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0711","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0711.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ww6p-x9mv-7hjc/GHSA-ww6p-x9mv-7hjc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6520b7035e49edd5877b71a9dd144df4ccfe9c24/2000/CVE-2000-0711.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0556","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0706","title":"Luca Deri ntop 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ntop 1.2 a7-9 及 1.3.1 版本的 Web 模式中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标发送特制 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响运行 ntop Web 模式的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0706"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18.627","remediation":"立即升级 ntop 至 1.3.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Web 模式下的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 ntop 的 Web 管理界面（使用 -n 参数启动），仅通过命令行方式使用 ntop 进行网络监控，以降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000830","http://www.osvdb.org/1513","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1576","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20150","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0706","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0706.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qxpp-jg53-wch8/GHSA-qxpp-jg53-wch8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--944784b0-60ad-4579-9b6e-15e3ee8d9860.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/2000/20000830.data","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0556.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0554","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0705","title":"Luca Deri ntop 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ntop 的 Web 管理界面存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 `..`（点点）路径穿越攻击读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 ntop 1.2 a7-9 版本，攻击者利用 Web 模式下的输入过滤缺陷构造恶意 URL，可越权访问 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感系统文件，导致信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0705"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18.493","remediation":"升级 ntop 至 2.0 及以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，应在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 ntop web 管理界面的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用目录遍历所需的特殊字符序列。当前强烈建议迁移至 ntopng（ntop 现代版本）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0459.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1496","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-049.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1550","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20143","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0705","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0705.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p7c9-q84g-w8qj/GHSA-p7c9-q84g-w8qj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b942b462-6593-4999-85c4-4cf345d333e3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0553","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0704","title":"SGI Omron WorldView Wnn 亚洲语言服务器远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SGI Omron WorldView Wnn 4.2 及 WorldView 6.5 的亚洲语言服务器组件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 JS_OPEN、JS_MKDIR 或 JS_FILE_INFO 命令，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0704"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18.367","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 安全公告 20000803-01-A 提供的补丁，或升级 FreeWnn 至 1.1.1 及以上版本。对于仍在使用 Omron WorldView 6.5 或 Wnn4 4.2.x 的系统，由于厂商已停止支持，建议迁移至现代输入法框架（如 IBus 或 Fcitx），并在网络边界防火墙阻断 Wnn 服务端口（默认 22273/TCP）以限制外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/11080","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1603","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5163","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20163","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0704","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0704.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/wnn_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-m283-5933-pjcq/GHSA-m283-5933-pjcq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1603/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0552","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0703","title":"Perl suidperl 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"suidperl（sperl）5.00503 版本在调用 /bin/mail 发送错误报告时，未正确过滤文件名中的 \"~!\" 转义序列。本地攻击者可利用 \"interactive\" 环境变量结合包含该转义序列的文件名触发 suidperl 执行，从而以 mail 程序权限执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Perl 5.00503 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0703"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18.217","remediation":"升级 Perl 至 5.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 suidperl 的 ~! 转义序列过滤缺陷。如无法升级，可移除 suidperl 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidperl），或直接删除 suidperl 可执行文件，改用 sudo 替代 setuid 提权方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0022.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0086.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0113.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0153.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-026.0.txt","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_59.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-048.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1547","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-August/000017.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20142","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0703.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0703.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0703","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2000-0703.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0703.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0703.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fwmf-9cw3-w3x3/GHSA-fwmf-9cw3-w3x3.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/TO_DO","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f72991dd-369f-4d8c-b212-f3a56fc44fcc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0552.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0552.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0552.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0551","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0702","title":"HP HP-UX net.init RC 脚本符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 的 net.init RC 脚本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp/stcp.conf 与目标文件之间建立符号链接，当系统以 root 权限执行 net.init 脚本时，会覆盖任意文件，导致权限提升或系统破坏。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.00 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0702"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18.083","remediation":"升级到 HP-UX 11.0 或 11.11 (11i) 的累积补丁或安装 PHCO_22666 安全补丁。如无法升级，删除 net.init 脚本的 setuid/setgid 位（chmod u-s /sbin/init.d/net.init），并在执行前创建 /tmp/stcp.conf 为只读空文件防止符号链接劫持。同时限制本地用户对敏感系统文件的写入权限作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0261.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1602","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5131","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0702","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0702.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-225c-mv8x-h9xj/GHSA-225c-mv8x-h9xj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--17fbce87-0aac-449f-a641-c16ddecd78f7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0551.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0551.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0550","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0699","title":"HP HP-UX FTPD 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 的 FTP 服务程序（ftpd）存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 PASS 命令提交特制的格式化字符串参数触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，且已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0699"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17.697","remediation":"立即安装 HP 安全补丁 PHNE_22307 或更新版本，修复 ftpd 中 PASS 命令的格式化字符串漏洞。如无法打补丁，可在 inetd 配置中禁用 FTP 服务（注释掉 /etc/inetd.conf 中 ftp 行并重启 inetd），改用 SFTP 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0028.html","htt