_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0546.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0546.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0543","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0695","title":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 pgxconfig 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Raptor GFX 配置工具 pgxconfig 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向命令行选项传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得提升的权限。该漏洞影响 Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 2.3.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞，无法远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0695"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17.183","remediation":"立即移除 pgxconfig 的 setuid 权限（`chmod u-s $(which pgxconfig)`），并将该二进制文件权限修改为仅 root 可执行（`chmod 700 $(which pgxconfig)`）。如业务上无需使用该配置工具，可直接删除 pgxconfig 二进制文件。由于 Tech-Source 已停止支持该产品且无官方安全更新，建议迁移至受支持的替代显卡解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20147","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0695","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0695.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gm87-84c8-m332/GHSA-gm87-84c8-m332.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83004/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0542","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0691","title":"The user wants me to generate a Chinese title for CVE-2000-0691 in the format \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\". From the known information: - Vendor: Gert Doering (or could be \"Gert Doering mgetty\") - Product: mgetty (specifically faxrunq and faxrunqd components) - Vulnerability type: Symbolic link traversal / symlink attack The vulnerability is about mgetty's faxrunq and faxrunqd allowing local users to create or modify arbitrary files via a symlink attack. A good Chinese title would be: \"Gert Doering mgetty 符号链接遍历漏洞\" or \"Gert Doering mgetty 本地符号链接攻击漏洞\" Let me think about the best format. The example is \"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞\". So: - Vendor: Gert Doering - Product: mgetty (faxrunq/faxrunqd) - Vuln type: 符号链接遍历漏洞 / 符号链接攻击漏洞 / 本地文件创建或修改漏洞 The vulnerability is about symlink attack leading to arbitrary file creation/modification. So it should be something like \"符号链接漏洞\" or \"符号链接遍历漏洞\". I'll go with: Gert Doering mgetty 符号链接遍历漏洞<value","description":"mgetty 软件包中的 faxrunq 和 faxrunqd 组件存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /var/spool/fax/outgoing/ 目录下创建指向目标文件的符号链接 .last_run，诱使 faxrunq 以特权进程身份操作该链接，从而实现对目标文件的任意创建或修改。该漏洞影响 mgetty 1.1.19 至 1.22.8 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用前提为攻击者拥有本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0691"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.667","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.22 或更高版本，该版本已修复 faxrunq/faxrunqd 对 /var/spool/fax/outgoing/.last_run 的符号链接竞争条件问题。如无法升级，可移除 faxrunq 和 faxrunqd 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/faxrunq /usr/bin/faxrunqd）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0329.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0330.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-029.0.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1612","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0691.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0691","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0691.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0691.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-229w-c447-wm6p/GHSA-229w-c447-wm6p.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0691.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a7d8edb1-9ef6-4bb5-977f-870564269fbe.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0542.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0542.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0539","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0689","title":"CGI Script Center Account Manager 管理密码更改漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center Account Manager LITE/PRO 1.0 存在权限验证缺失漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接调用 amadmin.pl 脚本并传递 setpasswd 参数，从而未经授权修改管理员密码，获取系统管理权限。该漏洞影响 Account Manager LITE/PRO 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或实施访问控制措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0689"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.410","remediation":"立即删除或限制访问 amadmin.pl 脚本，在 Apache 配置中添加 <Location /cgi-bin/amadmin.pl> Deny from all </Location> 阻止外部直接调用。如业务需要，升级到厂商修复版本或迁移至其他成熟账户管理方案。同时确保 CGI 目录不对外暴露管理端脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0291.html","http://www.cgiscriptcenter.com/acctlite/","http://www.osvdb.org/13341","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1604","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20165","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0689","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0689.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhgh-vxgw-ph3w/GHSA-hhgh-vxgw-ph3w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--19476675-820f-4f2b-8e65-c2f048f7f2e9.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0538","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0688","title":"CGI Script Center Subscribe Me Lite 未授权管理员密码修改漏洞","description":"Subscribe Me LITE 是一款 CGI 脚本中心提供的邮件订阅管理工具，其管理员密码修改功能存在认证缺陷。远程攻击者无需任何身份验证，可直接向目标服务器上运行的 subscribe.pl 脚本发送带有 setpwd 参数的 HTTP 请求，即可绕过授权检查任意更改管理员密码，进而获取 Account Manager 模块的完整控制权限。该漏洞影响 Subscribe Me LITE 2.0 及更早版本，攻击门槛低，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0688"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.277","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 Subscribe Me Lite 2.0，该产品厂商已不再提供安全更新。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的邮件订阅脚本（如 Mailman、phpList 等）。如无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面通过 .htaccess 或 location 规则限制对 subscribe.pl 的访问来源 IP，并移除 setpwd 参数处理逻辑或对该参数进行严格的身份鉴权校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0292.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96722957421029&w=2","http://www.cgiscriptcenter.com/subscribe/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1607","htt